      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不！\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>麻痹<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>才是首选！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0DFF01000A00100002FF0000069EBB75F900100002FF000000624D662F99969009FF01001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "陷入麻痹状态的宝可梦，\n移动速度会变慢！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "967751659EBB75F972B6600176845B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A79FB52A8901F5EA64F1A53D86162FF01001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "趁着对手慢吞吞的时候，\n一口气进攻，优雅地取胜！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D8177405BF9624B6162541E541E768465F65019FF0C000A4E0053E36C148FDB653BFF0C4F1896C5573053D680DCFF01001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "路过的这位！\n你来得正好！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8DEF8FC776848FD94F4DFF01000A4F6067655F976B63597DFF01001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "中毒还是麻痹！\n让我们测试一下哪种更厉害吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E2D6BD28FD8662F9EBB75F9FF01000A8BA962114EEC6D4B8BD54E004E0B54EA79CD66F453895BB354273002001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是说，来打宝可梦对战吧！\n我先上场哦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F8BF4FF0C676562535B9D53EF68A65BF962185427FF01000A621151484E0A573A54E6FF01001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
